#: scenario2:scenario2_2969C666_724A_4A50_88D6_FC4F569A6141
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f94dc219076f3220c1da9a77297f0631c34b4a8580cedbddbb668a738cf22cf7
#. default-sha256: e645dfd68900409db90b34871bd0f624737506c858fbe9b04ee5a6bb8fab30be
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_2969C666_724A_4A50_88D6_FC4F569A6141"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫The mansion sat near "
"the ocean."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫저택은 바다 가까이에 있"
"었습니다."

#: scenario2:scenario2_25E93473_3C7F_47AF_B45C_9D323A6F3D5A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e64e5851d08ee53d837c122a1fc6c8527442e3996080e92453778b34c1136dc1
#. default-sha256: 1c14e53a71be2accf77906248d8f920f92b69ad19f334969b7c0aa27770dc8ff
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_25E93473_3C7F_47AF_B45C_9D323A6F3D5A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫To say it was perched upon a cliff might make it sound rather intimidating..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫낭떠러지에 세워진 저택이라 하면 무서운 인상이 들겠지만, ⟪k:2⟫창가로 보이는 맑은 날의 바"
"다는,"

#: scenario2:scenario2_685FCB43_1481_45D7_BBBE_8FB9C1AC2175
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6789ebee34f0e555d3eb34d3244406195b41d129b69a3e017de3aa04f2333054
#. default-sha256: dc678c72692be02c2c77f1d87e433d3b621361e330b9edc60f632428eeaed04c
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_685FCB43_1481_45D7_BBBE_8FB9C1AC2175"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫but you could see the beautifully clear sea through the windows—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫a glittering "
"expanse of emerald and turquoise."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫에메랄드와 터키석을 흩뿌린 것처럼 아름다웠습니다."

#: scenario2:scenario2_A319AAD1_7EC5_4829_AA77_42149F2755E7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ac75f8d1651fced4e647d6b5fa4afbaae273d9c5545e90cfb6a1d7085f13dd30
#. default-sha256: 0b6f4f6abb7d94ef526261f12865be9334305c654fcaefd9baf665adfb105d83
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_A319AAD1_7EC5_4829_AA77_42149F2755E7"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫If the mansion had been in proper condition, it would have been breathtaking against "
"that backdrop."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫만약 저택이 잘 정비되었다면 ⟪k:2⟫배경과 어우러져 보는 이들이 모두 감탄했을 겁니다."

#: scenario2:scenario2_0159B64C_5EDC_4035_9E3A_A504D7D567BF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4a40bc172a4f23a2d79face68120569eedd4562840649de985e02683dd1a631d
#. default-sha256: de8118dcc3ef03daef46186a2191cb783a3aecb233d0b66198065c0f479b608a
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_0159B64C_5EDC_4035_9E3A_A504D7D567BF"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I even wanted to plant orange trees in the garden."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫제가 ⟪k:1⟫정원에 오렌지 나무를 심고 싶을 지경이었거든요."

#: scenario2:scenario2_C0EFF7A2_48B2_4EB6_AF03_BD062798B84A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c848022ee08ebb0721bdb5a9de2c81d6480518cc40d7d2bef7410b4b5d38392d
#. default-sha256: a571c6b7c30cd52cbdbdcde155b96536f0ecf267d402af885d1dad05094ee5da
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_C0EFF7A2_48B2_4EB6_AF03_BD062798B84A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Though it was a tumultuous era, the sun still shone bright upon the land, which only served "
"to emphasize the house’s unsightliness."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫전란의 시대였지만 ⟪k:1⟫대지를 비추는 태양은 밝았으며, ⟪k:2⟫그렇기에 저택은 더욱 초라했습니다."

#: scenario2:scenario2_F40581AD_5819_4290_BCF0_FDEF7F40476F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 55ab99278ba43235be5a3ca8c6654de7722dc5f8951192c6c7925a19bbd7d059
#. default-sha256: 2181bbd85dfe24c5f691fa1d1915bfed5603321fac7a211bae48ad8b9443418b
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_F40581AD_5819_4290_BCF0_FDEF7F40476F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Oh yes, perhaps I should give you some more background information. ⟪k:1⟫At that period in "
"time, a war had just drawn to a close."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫전란……, ⟪k:1⟫아아, ⟪k:2⟫설명이 부족했군요.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫이 당시에는 ⟪k:5⟫때마침 한 전쟁이 끝난 직"
"후였습니다."

#: scenario2:scenario2_B6FE0EFE_F238_4376_A78D_6B7BADCD9866
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 99b8cd5a12452b9445f252e672a4f100025533d3ec01e638b0387785912ebf00
#. default-sha256: edd8bd0e8268868b01b0a087008e8d4bb7ccd6a54a86e63cf3546a6ab05ca355
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_B6FE0EFE_F238_4376_A78D_6B7BADCD9866"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫The once gorgeous wetlands were infested with crows picking at decaying "
"remains. Bodies of soldiers fallen in battle continually washed up on the shores of coastal "
"villages."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫원래는 아름다웠을 그 지방의 습지에도 ⟪k:5⟫시체를 쪼아먹는 까마귀가 몰렸"
"고, ⟪k:6⟫해변 마을에는 전쟁통에 죽은 시체가 자꾸 물결에 쓸려 오는 등――"

#: scenario2:scenario2_7B0AC144_0BB9_4AFB_97DD_31740DBF1CB0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ebf686f020b01b1afdce5a9c916387f8db2e7ed386c7d302628da95ad315ef80
#. default-sha256: f1b7d4a70688cbaccec90be288aafb1cc3e1f656a6b4bd9cdae1859912f50441
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_7B0AC144_0BB9_4AFB_97DD_31740DBF1CB0"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The people wanted nothing more than for the curtain to draw on that deeply political contest."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫사람들은 정략만이 도사리는 전쟁의 종언을 학수고대했습니다."

#: scenario2:scenario2_B8D6AF17_A0A1_476A_9A57_430A2AB83B0A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 53d7e7201a4dac84f3da8487851ce0eee657ce395339cc224cf6385ac006cae2
#. default-sha256: ad092aeaa89771d2178a47cbe862936b029ede4e71960eb93df5966b7dc9337a
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_B8D6AF17_A0A1_476A_9A57_430A2AB83B0A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And when it finally did, the kingdom, with its richly fertile shores, was stripped of its "
"independence, beginning a new era under new rule."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그 결과, ⟪k:1⟫비옥한 해변 왕국은 ⟪k:2⟫자치권을 박탈되는 형태로 새로운 막을 열었지요."

#: scenario2:scenario2_A9FF47C2_8D32_4008_AB0B_61249DC285D0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 731311da458771277162244c31f60cf5a5d16d4c499f5eb646d3b2835eb4d454
#. default-sha256: bbfb711f864706a47cd2562544eb691de7ae8980152724b58e7bea650fe3a302
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_A9FF47C2_8D32_4008_AB0B_61249DC285D0"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The people were exhausted, their spirits wasted away."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫사람들은 피폐해져서 ⟪k:1⟫인심도 흉흉했습니다."

#: scenario2:scenario2_C7EED3DA_F03C_489C_9F20_EE195A4DDC86
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5eed65a49cc5712185f657c9d7ddf13e35b66c22f75c319e76453a42479267ce
#. default-sha256: 469b9df7a430929b357e02a24078498655748ac23678a76f88d6b42c6eeac99b
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_C7EED3DA_F03C_489C_9F20_EE195A4DDC86"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And the splendor of the ocean and sky did nothing to help."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫바다와 하늘은 저토록 아름답건만……."

#: scenario2:scenario2_765E8C91_48F4_49B8_8547_EF0E80F51144
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 02f8c72fc54a32586804ae388e60359e647cc543d8fc36589a4c0398c29e3739
#. default-sha256: 898d00cc380f3ef088f928b4bc0d148b7c19d2f74d114b967c7b1f4d501ae75e
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_765E8C91_48F4_49B8_8547_EF0E80F51144"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫In my mind, the beast was emblematic of the times—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫emaciated and enveloped in the "
"scent of blood."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫저는 ⟪k:1⟫그 짐승이 그 시대의 상징처럼 느껴졌습니다.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫피냄새를 두른 ⟪k:4⟫굶주린 짐승."

#: scenario2:scenario2_B395005F_CE73_4906_BCB7_C1626238D28A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 335afa09248f4cbf222b9a4e22c6fdc2f889a0b814157d5b03f8fb9561cd8cf1
#. default-sha256: 876c1d2c0032e9d7eb692f38c30f23c086de151cf0a449f162ca2a2c190c0cdb
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_B395005F_CE73_4906_BCB7_C1626238D28A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But the war came to an end. ⟪k:1⟫Thus the beast did not have to remain a beast, I thought."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫하지만 전쟁은 끝났습니다.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫그러니…… ⟪k:3⟫예, ⟪k:4⟫짐승이 사람이 되어도 되지 않을까요?"

#: scenario2:scenario2_EF4D48BD_1DEF_4547_9C87_2A8273C54029
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a4eca1d20f225f3b071dddd05478d1dacff301366b466e89d0ad3598228e69c8
#. default-sha256: 6a9b5373c3dcd58ca3f25a0031ed978481e6b3a106d9a154b507e07d03f5e785
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_EF4D48BD_1DEF_4547_9C87_2A8273C54029"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Did he?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그렇지 않은지요……?"

#: scenario2:scenario2_B3B52B41_BC9E_441C_A36F_517C882497EB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fca4182fe2124d789c0420754c8b55f5f456b38485f925075f8cf014b2c9b1f4
#. default-sha256: d815179c5a635b49e8f1878ffb5cd57a11fb8d968c9e742c09ee064d7d179c89
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_B3B52B41_BC9E_441C_A36F_517C882497EB"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫And so, I endeavored to make the beast more human-like."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫저는 짐승을 사람답게 꾸미려 했습니다."

#: scenario2:scenario2_36A1DD21_9EA4_4212_8CD9_A97D7F84D621
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9e990de41085281fefba1e8d2ddf664534eda00b11fdf6a370abf68d90b667c7
#. default-sha256: 77d7fdb7af2584489796764241a3a47cc7ddaec3bfcaa7fa21b391631788a864
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_36A1DD21_9EA4_4212_8CD9_A97D7F84D621"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫First, I needed to do something about his appearance."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫먼저 외형부터 잘 가꾸어야 했지요."

#: scenario2:scenario2_FE16B9C9_16C1_4888_9F02_485BEF2C7FF1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0948c9868df326cd4117fbd5a76f4cd249e344ad4c990e898acca7c69996928c
#. default-sha256: b62a38330f9802295787cd9c25d0446d7b7243abdb70497b306b20cfe19af7a3
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_FE16B9C9_16C1_4888_9F02_485BEF2C7FF1"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I would draw a bath, scrub away all the filth, and dress him in clothing left in the mansion."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫물을 끓여 ⟪k:1⟫짐승을 씻기고, ⟪k:2⟫저택에 남은 옷을 입히려 했는데……."

#: scenario2:scenario2_48B55AE9_720E_4D2B_ACE8_AE4BB780A80C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7cd4c508246253835c46ecfda44310b85370076cbd4f5ff23b706cc02cc1aa1e
#. default-sha256: c136c8516438b5db045512a7bb2510488d2bd7370bc7819cd93ae101f6764102
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_48B55AE9_720E_4D2B_ACE8_AE4BB780A80C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫However, having sat unused for fifty years, the majority of garments had been devoured by "
"insects and were of little use."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫50년이나 ⟪k:1⟫방치했다 보니 ⟪k:2⟫옷은 대부분 상해서 ⟪k:3⟫써먹을 길이 없었습니다."

#: scenario2:scenario2_D98AAD6D_E96B_4693_A747_C4715DFAB52D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 25a9062a4ae8ab110051a6e0f09e03ffb5cbbb30548872409e50a6442ba14080
#. default-sha256: a03b39d25fa0bfed505fcf8423fb2e8e9819288fb33a3bbcabc9e20427a0b5ea
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_D98AAD6D_E96B_4693_A747_C4715DFAB52D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫So I searched the mansion top to bottom for anything the beast could wear, heated up some "
"coals, and set to work ironing what I found."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫짐승을 위해 그나마 입을 만한 옷을 찾아내어 ⟪k:1⟫불을 쬔 숯을 마련한 후, ⟪k:2⟫필사적으로 다리"
"미질을 했습니다."

#: scenario2:scenario2_A38703AC_3901_46C2_8B90_D4A6D91C8C6F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 25e09f0f94dd392fc79515749390ce6db19ccad6679efd54d9f6df77173865cb
#. default-sha256: 9a874717213e4c8639af8da0fbd33051c52f8e38f7a3b5478f67f3c58ced42f9
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_A38703AC_3901_46C2_8B90_D4A6D91C8C6F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫At the time, steam irons had not yet been invented. We used plates of iron heated with coals."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫그 당시에는 ⟪k:1⟫아직 ⟪k:2⟫스팀 다리미도 없었기에 ⟪k:3⟫숯으로 달군 철판이 다리미였습니다."

#: scenario2:scenario2_D14A52B0_E3D7_45DA_AC8E_0606CC01932A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cb2ce1bc0e8eae167f4888c691230b3be06e9abfb1ca3602ee926d8464e85359
#. default-sha256: 49d1af134686b06e572516c03a94754f96f3975a9e289cb646003b1589dcc09b
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_D14A52B0_E3D7_45DA_AC8E_0606CC01932A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫They somewhat resembled kettles."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫생긴 건 프라이팬이랑 비슷했던가요."

#: scenario2:scenario2_C7E77E07_8625_4BD3_B4B1_D25477A405FE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 725f2050f3cb58fb4f17100ea19787234f7d2ce2e02c03d5c79deb2e45197034
#. default-sha256: 5b065bca47f4b5fe83d2b78f61beb5d66596ad4baaef569832ffa76d9eb41285
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_C7E77E07_8625_4BD3_B4B1_D25477A405FE"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫I even prepared meals for the beast, in order to teach him proper table "
"manners."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫식사 매너도 익히게 하고자, ⟪k:4⟫제가 ⟪k:5⟫짐승에게 요리도 대접했답니다."

#: scenario2:scenario2_07E03522_87A9_419B_9706_B7016EF22D0F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 36e1b7774f7d5542887dc502891ace8ee43ef0be55410ce658f89eebf8d57ba7
#. default-sha256: 9989245737cd6ac87c4e5608ed31e96589b0c397aa9c88e24908d359f2b9d22a
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_07E03522_87A9_419B_9706_B7016EF22D0F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Although, with the mansion in a nearly uninhabitable state of disarray, there was only so "
"much I could do in the kitchen."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫하지만 정작 ⟪k:1⟫이 당시 저택은 살기 힘들 만큼 휑한 상태였기에 ⟪k:2⟫주방 준비도 엉망진창……."

#: scenario2:scenario2_44DCF1A1_DCDB_4D0D_85B8_19709B8DCE59
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
